  ],
  "why": "CAP-0067 allows to_muxed_id as u64, bytes or string. Bytes are not a fixed length: here 4. A reader that pads or truncates them to 32 bytes reports a different routing ID; the event comes from a custom contract, so nothing moves on the ledger.",
